# CSSE past-paper source material and MCQ batches derived from it are
# copyrighted ("may not be photocopied or otherwise reproduced... without
# permission in writing from CSSE") and must not be published to this
# public GitHub repo. Kept locally for personal development/practice use
# only. See plan/MVP1-Content-to-Quiz-Plan.md for the seeding workflow.
docs/official-papers/

# Year 3/4 mock-test content (source docx + generated MCQ JSON) is the
# user's own original material, not copyrighted like CSSE's, but stays
# local-only by their choice rather than published in this public repo.
# The questions themselves are already seeded into the live database
# (Supabase), so the deployed app works fine without these files present.
docs/Year3 content/
docs/Year 4 Content/

# Certification Prep source content (quiz questions + flashcards).
# Most of this is originally-authored, grounded in Anthropic's genuinely
# public course documentation - kept local-only by the same convention as
# the other docs/ content folders above, not because of a copyright
# problem. One exception found during the 19-20 September 2026
# legal/copyright audit: two files here WERE derived from gated/paywalled
# course content, not public docs - those were archived into this
# folder's own _flagged-paywalled-content/ subfolder with a README, and
# the corresponding database rows were removed from production. See
# plan/Legal-and-Copyright-Production-Audit.md for the full history.
docs/Professional Certifications/

# Original unlicensed/unknown-provenance avatar images, archived (not
# deleted) during the 19-20 September 2026 legal/copyright audit - see
# plan/Legal-and-Copyright-Production-Audit.md. Kept locally only so they
# can be reviewed before permanent deletion; must never be committed.
apps/web/public/_removed-unlicensed-assets/
